sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Doc as Emergency Doctor
    participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
    participant OPD as OPD Module
    participant PEP as PEP Middleware
    participant Cerbos as Cerbos PDP<br/>(sidecar)
    participant DB as OPD Database
    participant Audit as Audit Stream

    Note over Doc,Audit: Doctor needs psychiatric records outside their department — normal access denied

    Doc->>FE: View patient record<br/>(psychiatric, different dept)
    FE->>OPD: GET /opd/patients/{id}/records<br/>(Bearer JWT)

    OPD->>PEP: Intercept request
    PEP->>Cerbos: CheckResources (loopback gRPC)
    Note over PEP,Cerbos: Principal: {doctor, dept: cardiology}<br/>Resource: {sensitivity: psychiatric,<br/>  dept: psychiatry}<br/>Action: view

    Cerbos-->>PEP: EFFECT_DENY
    PEP-->>FE: 403 Forbidden

    FE-->>Doc: Access denied — Break Glass available

    Doc->>FE: Activate Break Glass<br/>(enter reason: "emergency consult")
    FE->>OPD: GET /opd/patients/{id}/records<br/>+ X-Break-Glass: true<br/>+ X-Break-Glass-Reason: "emergency consult"

    OPD->>PEP: Intercept with break-glass flag
    PEP->>Cerbos: CheckResources (loopback gRPC)
    Note over PEP,Cerbos: Same principal + resource,<br/>but action now: view:break_glass<br/>+ attr: {reason: "emergency consult"}

    Cerbos->>Cerbos: Break-glass policy evaluates:<br/>→ role physician = eligible<br/>→ reason field present = required<br/>→ ALLOW with review_required flag

    Cerbos-->>PEP: EFFECT_ALLOW<br/>+ metadata: {review_required: true}

    PEP->>Audit: Log break-glass access<br/>(who, what, when, reason,<br/>review_required: true)

    PEP->>OPD: Proceed with audit flag

    OPD->>DB: Fetch psychiatric record
    DB-->>OPD: Record data
    OPD-->>FE: 200 OK (record data)
    FE-->>Doc: Record displayed<br/>(banner: "Break Glass — under review")

    Note over Audit: Post-hoc review workflow triggered<br/>→ compliance officer reviews within 24h
